# Secrets. `.hf_token` holds the Hugging Face token the trainer picks up by
# default (see src/hf_auth.py). It must never be committed: a token that reaches
# the published history has to be revoked, as the one hard-coded in
# tools/misc/push_to_hub.py did.
.hf_token
*.token
.env
